.el .ds Aq '
.TH ckman-piv-keys-verify-attest 1  ckman 
.SH NAME
ckman\-piv\-keys\-verify\-attest \- Verify fresh attestation against a trusted root and the live device
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBckman\-piv\-keys\-verify\-attest\fR [\fB\-\-ca\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISLOT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Verify fresh attestation against a trusted root and the live device.
.PP
Checks the fixed target \-> F9 signer \-> root chain; no revocation or anti\-replay check is performed. No PIN or management key is required.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-ca\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
One P\-256 PEM/DER root certificate, replacing the built\-in CanoKey PIV Root CA No. 1. No system roots or network lookup are used
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fISLOT\fR>
Ordinary PIV slot containing a key generated on the device
